+            any empty FIFO that has recieved a read pulse.
+            This bit will stay set until the next reset.";
+            sw = r;
+        } FIFO_READ_ERR[29:29];
+        field {
+            desc = "This bit will be set to one when any of the source bits (bits 0 through 15 of this
